://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味噌カツおいしすぎる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはカツには味噌の時代だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすか、まりか、ひなちま、みなみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わおっっJC‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にんじんのお漬物があったのですが\n3人はおいしさをわかってくれなかったぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人の分も食した笑\nにんじんのお漬物おいしいっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊\nそして私ついに自己紹介で\nあだ名募集宣言をしたのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんとまりかが一番多かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あれ⁇←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントでも沢山考えてくださって\nありがとうございました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんそれぞれオリジナルの\nあだ名で呼んでくださる方も\n沢山いるので基本はまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...がいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからも普段まりかって呼ばれてるからに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012